        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ ŋituŋa ŋul kiboiyoto anakiboisyo a ŋakan a ŋace: Alo Etam, alo Ain, alo Rimon, alo Tocen ka alo Asan, ",
          "type": "text",
