              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ta ŋirerya ŋice ŋulu erimokinito nen kidiŋ, todoyosi Kwap To, todolo lotaun ŋolo a Baalas. Erae ŋun ŋakigireta ŋuna kiricito ikes, ŋuna a ŋikalya kec ka ŋakiboisyo ŋuna kiboiyoto ikes.",
          "type": "text",
