          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae ŋikilyok ŋul ŋikarikok a ŋatekerin kec. Apotu ŋituŋa a ŋatekerin kec tolalata nooi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "topetaros todolo neni elomarere Gedor, Kide akadipaalat, iwarito ŋinya ŋulu a ŋamesekin kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes toryamut ŋalup ŋuna ajokak ka ŋinya ŋulu ajokak, alotooma akwap ŋin, torae ŋina amam egurigur, ekisil bon ayai. Kerae sek akwap ŋin ŋina kiboiyoto Ŋiami ekiŋaren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepote ŋikilyok ŋulu igiritae ŋirorwa kec ŋul nakwap ŋin apaki ŋina araakar Esekia erwosit ŋolo a Yudaya. Kepotu ikes kitijioto Ŋiami anakiboisyo kec kaapei ka Ŋimeuni ŋulu keyakasi nen, ido kepotu kiritasi ikes a nen jik, ikwapei ileereoto ŋakiro tari nakoloŋit na, kepotu nai ikes kiboikinos nen, anerae keya ŋinya a ŋamesekin kec nen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepotu Ŋisimeoni ŋice ŋamiae ŋakan ŋulu kerikito ŋikilyok lu: Pelatia, Nearia, Repaia ka Usiel lokoku a Isi toremo Seir, akwap ŋina a ŋikamukumukui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
